                        ],
                        "form": "своеобы́чливей"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "59fbcd45-1f3c-388d-a10a-0fd4eaba948d",
                        "entry_id": "85214a96-0aa6-35e0-b46b-8f5d170c47d2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. то же, что своенравный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "19519d82-bd89-44fa-97b5-b972e41a9c68",
                                "sense_id": "59fbcd45-1f3c-388d-a10a-0fd4eaba948d",
                                "text": "Своеобычлива у вас маменька-то, ну да это ничего, душа-то у неё добрая."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e470fb1f-830d-49db-8b00-fab50609d125",
                        "source_entry_id": "85214a96-0aa6-35e0-b46b-8f5d170c47d2",
                        "source_sense_id": "59fbcd45-1f3c-388d-a10a-0fd4eaba948d",
                        "target_lang_word": "capricious",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "capricious",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                        "entry_id": "523a41c1-9ed8-3f1f-bd74-d5473cd1db43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Impulsive and unpredictable; determined by chance, impulse, or whim."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f547e6ac-619c-4ad1-9e0f-5db1a65fcc5c",
                                                "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                                "text": "I almost died in a capricious winter storm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18399f7f-61a1-4504-86f4-011a25d88e85",
                                                "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                                "text": "Stringent rulers are unlikely to act capriciously."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91f79306-c73b-46e1-898f-a78553365dad",
                                                "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                                "text": "I am heere with thee, and thy Goats, as the moſt capricious Poet honeſt Ouid was among Gothes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0abd0bf3-5b3c-41d5-be6a-66cc5683db76",
                                                "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                                "text": "\"Capricious?\" And at this monsieur began to laugh. \"Oh no, I'm not capricious. I am very faithful. I am very constant. Comprenez?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a509b2c-e74b-4b24-9973-e28bc94120de",
                                                "sense_id": "b75416f9-2ae0-3c40-bcb8-79466ede1839",
                                                "text": "Although much has been learned about lightning and its effects through research and study, many questions are still unanswered and the upper limits of voltage, current and total energy that may be associated with lightning are not conclusively defined. The apparent capricious nature of lightning is evidenced by the range of extremes as well as, in some cases, the unique nature of the damage that results. Thus, to predict in the absence of physical evidence the exact mechanism of ignition in this particular case is not possible. By the same reasoning, in view of the known facts of this accident, there is no logical explanation for ignition of the flammable vapors other than some effect stemming directly from the lightning strike."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b75102e6-7cca-4745-a005-c6d780f3de41",
                        "source_entry_id": "85214a96-0aa6-35e0-b46b-8f5d170c47d2",
                        "source_sense_id": "59fbcd45-1f3c-388d-a10a-0fd4eaba948d",
                        "target_lang_word": "wayward",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wayward",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "427f6b90-0389-378a-bb86-a7ab5dbd71a3",
                                        "entry_id": "d39cc7e4-b1a6-322b-8c1f-1693137f84d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Given to wilful, perverse deviation from the expected norm; tending to stray."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "771c0f2f-ae04-4636-9372-2d927af9d247",
                                                "sense_id": "427f6b90-0389-378a-bb86-a7ab5dbd71a3",
                                                "text": "He is a brilliant fellow when he chooses to work—one of the brightest intellects of the University, but he is wayward, dissipated, and unprincipled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1e9d59c-e778-4a71-93bf-feeaddc3efe2",
                                                "sense_id": "427f6b90-0389-378a-bb86-a7ab5dbd71a3",
                                                "text": "Fancies are like shadows . . . you can’t cage them, they’re such wayward, dancing things."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3302595a-6244-4bd4-bcd7-dac6e9e23cd1",
                                                "sense_id": "427f6b90-0389-378a-bb86-a7ab5dbd71a3",
                                                "text": "The Ig Nobel awards are arguably the highlight of the scientific calendar. The prizes, which are the wayward son of the more righteous Nobels, are supposed to reward research that makes people laugh, then think."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c51c9663-ebf6-348a-90b9-06b3a43ed441",
                                        "entry_id": "d39cc7e4-b1a6-322b-8c1f-1693137f84d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obstinate, contrary and unpredictable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3048ebba-34e8-3c36-a57e-d041bc13c101",
                                        "entry_id": "d39cc7e4-b1a6-322b-8c1f-1693137f84d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not on target."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc2c4831-2550-4f65-b45a-42ece80c2084",
                                                "sense_id": "3048ebba-34e8-3c36-a57e-d041bc13c101",
                                                "text": "Bulgaria's only attacking weapon was the wayward shooting of Martin Petrov, whereas England's attacking options were awash with movement in the shape of Rooney, Young and Walcott."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
